      "content": "WINKWELL 1.  5252                                                  Bourne End                                                  Three Horse Shoes                                                  Public House TL 0206 5/240 II 2. C17, much altered.  Whitewashed plaster, gabled old tiled roof with plain early red brick chimneystack.  2 storeys, small casement windows.  Cut bracketted C18 or early C19 doorhood.  Later C19 verandah. Listing NGR: TL0264206374"
    }
